sequenceDiagram
    participant E as edit.js (laptop)
    participant A as web/api.py
    participant K as RecipeKeeper
    participant R as SqliteRecipeRepository
    E->>A: PUT /api/recipes/7 {base_version: 3, recipe}
    A->>K: update(7, draft, 3)
    K->>R: get(7, include_deleted=True)
    alt missing or deleted_at set (G-9)
        K-->>A: DeletedElsewhere
        A-->>E: 410 deleted_elsewhere
        Note over E: typed form kept, dialog: Save as new / Discard my changes
    else stored version 4 differs from 3
        K-->>A: ChangedElsewhere(current_version=4)
        A-->>E: 409 changed_elsewhere
        Note over E: dialog: Reload theirs (open /recipes/7) / Keep mine (PUT again with base_version 4)
    else versions match
        K->>R: update_if_version(7, draft, 3, now)
        R-->>K: Recipe version 4 (None means race lost: ChangedElsewhere)
        K-->>A: Recipe
        A-->>E: 200 {id: 7, version: 4}
        Note over E: navigate to /recipes/7 (read view)
    end
